Passenger ID: <ID>
Passenger Name: <Name>
Destination: <Destination>

PROCESS:

Processed:
Passenger ID: <ID>
Passenger Name: <Name>
Destination: <Destination>

CYCLE:

For every passenger processed during the cycle, print:

Processed:
Passenger ID: <ID>
Passenger Name: <Name>
Destination: <Destination>

If no passengers are waiting when PROCESS, NEXT, or CYCLE is requested:

No passengers waiting.

COUNT:

Passengers Waiting: <count>

DISPLAY:

Waiting Passengers:
Passenger ID: <ID>
Passenger Name: <Name>
Destination: <Destination>

If the waiting line is empty:

No passengers waiting.

